  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "Added\n- Introduced the Gaussian Weighted Median Filter (GMMF), providing advanced smoothing and correction capabilities. This method enhances data fidelity by reducing noise while preserving critical signal characteristics, offering more accurate results for complex workflows.\n- Added 'Alpha' parameter to 'ApplySmoothing' method (controls blending for Binomial Average / Binomial Median / Gaussian).\n- Excel export now includes 'Alpha' parameter value in the header.\n- CSV export now includes 'Alpha' parameter value in metadata.\n\nChanged\n- Improved documentation formatting for better clarity.\n\nFixed\n- Minor bugs fixed.",
